{"version":1,"key":"card:655","content":{"id":655,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d5872812-fbfb-4139-a3a5-fe06a6a1825b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器的事件模型定义了事件在元素上的触发顺序，根据 DOM Level 2 标准，事件模型分为三个阶段："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e34b9cec-935a-4de3-a3b5-e17c3ee61383","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3108e32f-528a-4612-9d33-b6415d45cab7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be804d2b-832c-4dc5-b536-ae256cc17598","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"捕获阶段：事件从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 向下传递到目标元素，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Window → Document → html → body → ... → 目标元素的父级"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"545c8ee3-6abb-4a18-97c0-d327df365238","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d00aab64-93ef-44fa-8d30-22646ec5e3cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目标阶段：实际触发事件的元素（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"event.target"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b970edc6-1e20-431a-ad43-cadd1297d09f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"55708c25-6a80-4d30-acf2-f1731f15dc96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"冒泡阶段：事件从目标元素向上传递到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"目标元素父级 → ... → body → html → Document → Window"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f8d1701-911f-4935-beff-413cabdfec14","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大多数交互事件都是可以冒泡的："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"77237730-0ee4-466f-afa7-bf357610ec9c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cc0f3d10-eefb-46a3-8bb0-4119dc195d93","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d35715fa-6725-409d-926a-ca8bd1e0c5bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"交互类："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click, dblclick, mousedown, mouseup, mousemove, keydown, keypress, keyup"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0f1b5bf7-fecd-4fa6-b37b-6e38506579c0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"77c50d4f-380b-4431-8c77-2e58a1e75e08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其他："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"change, submit, reset, input"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"59d55b49-f8aa-40ba-9a3d-44cd393e00b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通常涉及元素自身状态、资源加载或特定语义的事件不冒泡："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"bc6ea5dc-7242-4b6f-80e9-99e8a44441eb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2ae63a40-d910-4b65-914f-a955d57e64f8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6bf46b20-0d85-4a5b-b663-e5c476e5b4aa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"UI/焦点类："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"focus, blur"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（注意：对应的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"focusin, focusout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是冒泡的）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02d61b95-b75d-43f7-96d6-10ce0b6478ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"focus"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 冒泡，当一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"input"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获得焦点时，其父级 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"div"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"focus"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，这在逻辑上会让人误以为父级 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"div"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也获得了焦点（实际上只有输入框获得了焦点）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a4084a40-3c0b-4f19-9275-790ee4950588","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0726ead3-85b4-44a3-a65a-4131b9929a90","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"鼠标移动类："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mouseenter, mouseleave"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（注意：对应的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mouseover, mouseout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是冒泡的）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0331af0c-2c9d-4a22-856f-83c9ce8e75ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mouseenter/mouseleave"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这两个事件专门设计用于“进入/离开元素本身”。如果它们像 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mouseover/mouseout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 那样冒泡，那么鼠标在后代元素之间移动时，父级也会频繁触发事件，这往往不是开发者想要的，且会带来复杂的过滤逻辑和性能开销。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"238ccdc0-0635-403a-95f9-1c666bc3151a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"71c5bca1-4921-4ae1-a734-f8f315dd12bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"资源/加载类："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"load, unload, abort, error"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（例如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<img>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"error"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d48542aa-4167-4067-8873-276dd8efd476","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<img>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 图片加载完成，并不代表整个页面（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）加载完成。如果图片的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"load"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 冒泡到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，会导致 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window.onload"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 逻辑被错误触发"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"972f3ff0-30ca-4008-9094-06a17c0f84ef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"59b5bb4d-dadf-4553-87ac-3e18278ec67d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其他："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resize, scroll"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"2edf3053-edb2-468b-a485-c128c80bdcd5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"62e3cfb5-b457-4e6f-b586-6d480d79d672","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f3609ec3-e7d8-4ea3-bf83-fe57c3dfeab2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，假设有一个很长的页面可以滚动，页面中间有一个固定高度的小方块（div），其内部也可以滚动。如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件可以冒泡：当你滚动小方块时，事件冒泡到了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。此时，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上的滚动监听器会被触发，系统会误以为页面发生了滚动，从而错误地触发了一些业务逻辑，如显示「回到顶部」按钮，或者触发无限加载（Infinite Scroll），从而导致极其混乱的用户体验。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"12b31b6a-4940-4d8b-a8e4-e2ead3b50c7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在普通元素上不冒泡，但在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Document"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上触发的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件（即页面整体滚动），通常会冒泡给 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Window"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"220a4899-7285-4450-ba96-b2bc5cd98162","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"47c4e1cb-4a65-45d1-ae1c-94f405f6d6a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resize"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resize"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件只会在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上触发，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是顶部对象，因此自然也就没有冒泡的概念"}]}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["DOM/事件模型"],"createTime":1767247788084,"updateTime":1790895920866,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1790895920866}}